## Product Priority

The primary product objective is:

Social and remote media input
→ UBOS production
→ authoritative Program output
→ multi-destination output
→ unified two-way audience chat and moderation.

## Working Method

- Execute one milestone at a time.
- Reproduce the problem before editing.
- Reuse existing engines and architecture.
- Preserve the approved Control Room.
- Produce real execution evidence.
- Stop after the active milestone.
- Do not claim success from compilation, metadata, simulation, or mocks.

## Prohibited Work

Do not:

- add new speculative engines;
- redesign the Control Room;
- create duplicate command or runtime systems;
- expose unsupported controls;
- advance phases automatically;
- create release tags;
- modify unrelated files.

## Completion Standard

A capability is complete only when:

- the operator activates it;
- the real runtime executes it;
- the external result is verified;
- failure handling works;
- cleanup succeeds;
- acceptance tests pass.